{
  "format": "ayuvo-ai-providers",
  "notes": [
    "The BYOK provider registry, verified against provider docs on 2026-09-07.",
    "`id` is the persisted token: the iOS rawValue and the Android @SerialName, which are equal by contract.",
    "Android stores the enum NAME in its own flat preference keys; `android_case` is that name.",
    "Apple Intelligence is iOS-only, so `platforms` is per row.",
    "Both platforms keep their enums; AIVectorTests / AiVectorTests compare them with this file field by field.",
    "Known defect preserved verbatim: Ollama's text_models is `literal + models`, so 'qwen3.8' and 'gemma4' appear twice in the picker. This file records what the app does; de-duplicating it is a behaviour change and belongs in its own step.",
    "Google Vertex AI's key is a service-account JSON, not an API key; it is stored in the same place and always profile-scoped, because two projects is the motivating case."
